    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accustom</i> or <i>inure</i> one <i>to</i> a
